      "content": "Title: Adam Collis. Adam Collis is an American filmmaker and actor. He attended the Duke University from 1986 to 1990 and the University of California, Los Angeles from 2007 to 2010. He also studied cinema at the University of Southern California from 1991 to 1997. Collis first work was the assistant director for the Scott Derrickson's short \"Love in the Ruins\" (1995). In 1998, he played \"Crankshaft\" in Eric Koyanagi's \"Hundred Percent\".",
